window.products.push({"id":444050,"name":"Electric Lunch Box 60W Food Heater, 4 in 1 Portable Heated Lunch Box for Car Truck Work Adults, Leak Proof, Self Heating Lunch Box with 1.5L 304 SS Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t+MF53iLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of expensive and unhealthy fast food? Don't want to waste time off for queuing? Just plug in the power cord or connect the car adapter, flick the switch button of ABTACT lunch box, wait 15-25 minutes, and you can enjoy a hot lunch in the office, school, construction site, car or truck. Support 110V & 220V household power supply and 12V & 24V vehicle power supply. Portable sealed container: Put the cooked food into a 1.5L stainless steel container, cover it with a sealing cap, put it in the refrigerator directly, and carry it with insulated bag next day. The heated base and outer cover don't need to be taken home every day, a lightweight SS container is sufficient as a food loader! The 100% leak-proof design can perfectly fill the food with soup, so it's not need to worry about leakage during bumpy car. Quickly heat food: This 60W electric bento box can heat food in 15-25 minutes, one third less than other 40W regular lunch boxes. Still looking for a car microwave? The ABTACT electric lunch box will change the way drivers and couriers eat, and the busy journey will be accompanied by hot family meals. Designed for people who always ON THE GO: The heated base of the lunch box is composed of advanced circuit boards and heating plates, which can be adapted to 12V/24V/110/220V voltage, suitable for use in multiple scenarios. Keep your healthy recipes up, even on the go. Buy one for your husband, father, child or friend, it will be a special and practical gift! ABTACT box packs all: The portable switch lunch box comes with 1×electric lunch box, 1×SS container and sealing cap, 1×food grade plastic compartment that can hold 400ml extra food or fruit, 1×spoon and fork, 1×110V&220V 32 inches home adapter, 1×12V&24V 32 inches car adapter, 1×insulation bag. Please contact us if you have any questions about the portable food warmer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t+MF53iLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABTACT","source_asin":"B09SW1VTW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SW1VTW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SW1VTW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
