window.products.push({"id":444122,"name":"Nordic Ware Restaurant Cookware 8 Quart Stockpot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbU60IVGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Restaurant Cookware series is tested and certified by NSF International, the widely recognized and respected independent certification organization for public health safety. Extra heavyweight 3004 tempered aluminum alloy construction resists denting and warping. Triple riveted forged chrome steel handle with stay cool removable grips are safe for oven and broiler use. Teflon premium non-stick surfaces ensure easy release and clean up. 8 quart capacity. Proudly made in the USA by Nordic Ware Amazon.com A member of NordicWare's Restaurant cookware line, this 8-quart stockpot offers discerning home chefs the same top quality found in commercial kitchens. The six-gauge pressure-cast aluminum construction spreads heat quickly and uniformly without damaging hot spots (an annoying problem with inferior materials), and the dark interior absorbs heat for faster browning and shorter cooking times. With a quality nonstick finish, the pot also effortlessly releases food and cleans easily by hand or in the dishwasher. Another plus for demanding kitchens: The heavy-gauge metal resists dents and scratching, and a concave bottom eliminates warping--so go ahead and put it to work! Perfect for simmering soups and chili or steaming corn or crabs, the pot comes with a tight-fitting, stainless-steel lid that resists stains, odors, and corrosion, and features an arched, riveted loop handle. Two matching handles high on the pot's sides provide safe, balanced transporting. With a light gray exterior, this vessel has a sleek, modern style that looks handsome at the table or displayed on a hanging rack in the kitchen. The entire Restaurant line is NSF-certified for safety and comes with a 20-year limited warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbU60IVGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B000JZ13DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JZ13DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JZ13DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444123,"name":"Civil War Confederate General Stonewall Jackson 8x10 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HAtq-5mVL._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTIONPhoto print of a drawn portrait of Confederate General Thomas Jonathan \"Stonewall\" Jackson. Jackson had a reputation as a strong leader among Southerners, both military and civilian, during the Civil War. PHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive/AnonPHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive PHOTO IMAGE DATE: 1871IMAGE ID: LC2644ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HAtq-5mVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B071VBRPMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071VBRPMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071VBRPMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
