window.products.push({"id":444222,"name":"KEENZO Damascus Chef Knife 8 inch, Professional Kitchen Knives set, Ultra Sharp Japanese VG-10 Damascus Steel Cooking Knife, Ergonomic Blue Resin & Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBEbxCqkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【REAL Damascus Knife】Made of top quality 67-layer Damascus steel, KEENZO Damascus chef knife is manufactured with modern technology and traditional craftsmanship with razor sharp cutting core Japanese “Super-Steel” VG-10, containing about 0.95%-1.05% carbon. The steel is precisely processed with vacuum heat treatment and nitrogen cooling treatment, reaching the high hardness at 60±2 HRC, which makes the Damascus knives get better sharpness, providing unrivaled performance, superior corrosion resistance, and exceptional edge retention. 【Ultra-sharp V-shaped edge& Damascus pattern】The blade edge is hand sharpened by experienced knife smiths using the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method. Super sharp edges and perfect curvature (hand finished to a mirror polish at 16° per side) meet all the chef's requirements for the knife. Each side of the blade has 33 layers of Damascus steel. 66 alternating layers cover the blade, creating a unique natural pattern to minimize the drag for jelly-like smooth cuts and enhance non-stick performance. 【Unique handle construction & Ergonomic Design】 The blade of this chef knives is integrated with an agility and comfortable handle, creating the perfect grip. The first half of the handle is made of blue resin, Adding a splash of ocean-like flowing color to your kitchen. The back half is made of precious stable-wood. The perfect handle design combines with a luxurious resin material, making the resin's colorful properties exceptionally dazzling, while being durable, providing excellent control, flexibility and comfort for any hand. 【Multi-purpose kitchen knife & Non-stick function】 The Special wave texture on the Damascus cooking knife's blade and hand polished mirror surface are not only beautiful but strikingly help to reduce drag and stuck on food, ensuring the best flavor of food, which can help you easily handle daily kitchen tasks like chopping, slicing, dicing and mincing of all kinds of meat, vegetables, fruits and bread. Very suitable for professional chefs and cooking lovers. 【High-End Gift Choice】 In addition to being a tool for family kitchens, the chef knife is also a Damascus steel work of art. The knife is packed in a Elegantly black gift box, which is ideal for collectors and perfect for occasions such as Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Black Friday, Christmas day, New Year, Easter Day, Halloween, Birthday etc.. It is a ideal gift for home cooks, professional chefs, culinary enthusiasts culinary students and collectors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBEbxCqkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEENZO","source_asin":"B0BPHGW8MV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPHGW8MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPHGW8MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
