window.products.push({"id":444278,"name":"MINDPLUS Set of 12 Hand Crochet Doilies Cotton Crocheted Lace Doilies 6-8 Inches Round White Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f5CQjsD0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"package Contents: 12pcs vintage floral handmade crochet doilies  ---5pcs of 6.5 inch doilies,7pcs of 7-7.5 inch doilies --Dimensions may vary slightly within 5-8% due to hand crochet process  Great for Wedding,Tea Party,Birthday,Baby shower,Bridal shower,Mothers Day Christmas,New Year or any special occasion. WASHING AND MAINTENANCE:Machine wash cold delicate,but hand washing is highly suggested.Better after ironing.There will be a small amount of shrinkage phenomenon after washing, which is the characteristic of pure cotton,is a normal situation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f5CQjsD0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MINDPLUS","source_asin":"B07VG45JL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VG45JL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VG45JL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444279,"name":"Firewood Tote Bag - Oxford Fabric Log Carrier with Handles & Heavy Duty Straps - Large Durable Wood Holder with Wide Opening - Wood Stove & Fireplace ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811KWQWyVvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR TOTING FIREWOOD & MORE - Our large pink firewood bag isn't just for hauling logs and kindling; it can also be used to carry other items like groceries, gardening tools, or laundry. CONVENIENT TRANSPORT - With our log holder, you don't have to worry about leaving trails of wood chips, barks, splinters, or sawdust on floors or carpeting when bringing firewood indoors. USE IT FOR LONGER - Made from durable double-layer Oxford fabric and with reinforced stitching, you can count on our firewood carrier to help you carry loads of firewood for many years to come. STRONG YET COMFORTABLE - Our wood holder has sturdy black straps that won't snap even when carrying heavy loads. The handles are folded and double-sewn to make them more comfortable on the hands. EASY TO STORE - Our carrier tote bag can be folded down to a flat and compact size to make it easier to stow away in drawers or cabinets after use or bring with you to your next camping trip.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811KWQWyVvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gears Out","source_asin":"B08L465MHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L465MHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L465MHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444280,"name":"Litanika Purple Full Comforter Set, 3 Pieces Striped Reversible Bedding Set, Lightweight Soft All Season Down Alternative Comforter Set with Corner Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PXE1MzdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ MODERN STRIPED DESIGN ] Litanika has combined three color patchworks with classic striped pattern to complement each other wonderfully. Striping with colors achieves a stylish look for your room. Purple is often preferred by artists, this modern with a casual elegance bedding comforter set is a perfect choice for homeowners with sophisticated taste in decoration. Also, it is a great gift idea for all your loved ones on special occasions. [ PACKAGE INCLUDES ] Full Size Down Alternative Comforter Set: 1 stripe comforter Full (79x90 inches) with corner loops (can be fixed with your duvet cover), 2 envelope pillowcases (20x26 inches). Vacuum packaging. *Due to manual cutting, pattern of pillow sham is random. The pillow insert is not included. [ EXCELLENT CRAFTSMANSHIP & DURABLE ] Hidden stitching design secures the filling in place to avoid shifting and clumping while presenting a original look of the comforter. Made of light brushed & pre-washed microfiber, with high tensile strength, Litanika comforter sets are durable for longtime use. While the use of reactive printing and dyeing technology makes the color of Litanika comforter set bright. Even after multiple washes, it will look as vibrant as the first night you enjoyed it. [ ULTRA-SOFT for ALL SEASON ] We adopt 100% breathable microfiber filling that offers good fluffy performance of the lightweight comforter. By clean processing technology, skin-friendly fabrics achieve softness to provide you with exceptional comfort. After hydrophilic treatment, comforter achieves fast absorb moisture and sweat, quick drying, and regulate your temperature cleverly to keep cooler, drier, and warmer for a better sleeping experience, which is comfortable and warm for most people. [ EASY CARE & SERVICE ] Machine wash in the delicate cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry on low heat. Do not bleach or iron. Due to the vacuum packaging, the comforter will arrive shriveled. Before first use, you need to wash it to reduce wrinkles, then tumble dry with low heat. Or you can expose it to sunlight and tap gently, then the comforter will fluff up nicely after hours. If you have any needs or questions, let us know via amazon email and we will give you a timely solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PXE1MzdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Litanika","source_asin":"B0BHNR9QHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHNR9QHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHNR9QHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
