window.products.push({"id":444586,"name":"Boska Cheese Fondue Party Set Nero - Black Cast Iron Fondue Pot - Wedding Registry Items Small Kitchen Appliances for up to 4 Persons Wedding Registry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719C8DtPm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FONDUESET: Enjoy hours of cheese fondue with the small Nero fondue set. With fondue pan, fondue forks and burner, you have everything you need to start a delicious cheese fondue or chocolate fondue CHEESE FONDUE FOR 6 PEOPLE: With its 1.3 liter (44 oz) capacity and 6 fondue sticks, the Nero set is specially designed for fondue for 6 people. CERAMIC FONDUEPAN: The black fondue pan is made of high quality ceramic. It can therefore be used on an open fire, on the gas stove or in the oven. CLEANING: after use the fondue pot is easy to clean, as it is dishwasher safe 10 YEAR WARRANTY: Every day at BOSKA we work hard to ensure that our products are of the highest possible quality. That's why we can offer a 10-year warranty on our Food Tools","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719C8DtPm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B084T7QVN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084T7QVN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084T7QVN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
