window.products.push({"id":444588,"name":"Guess I'll Just Die DnD Dungeons and Dragons Coffee Mug - 15oz Large Ceramic Dishwasher and Microwave Safe Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ckJ4hpKCL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Be the envy of your DnD or Pathfinder table and bounce back from imminent death with humor. Whether you need a caffeine jolt during a marathon gaming session, while listening to Critical Role, or just to make sure you don't draw attacks of opportunity in the morning this mug will absolutely keep a smile on your face and your energy high.  Perfect for coffee, tea, and hot chocolate, this durable white ceramic mug comes in the most popular 15oz size with a classic shape. The original design makes these ceramic coffee cups a delightful part of your everyday life. These cups are both useful and thoughtful, making them one of the most popular gifting options for Christmas, birthdays, and other important events.  The product art is custom designed in our Ohio studio and permanently printed onto the coffee mugs and cups. No vinyl or stickers are used so you can be confident that your mug will last. Colors may appear different on different devices. While we try to represent things as accurately as possible, there could be some variation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ckJ4hpKCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"For Whom the Book Tolls","source_asin":"B07MM6JXLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MM6JXLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MM6JXLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444589,"name":"LKKL Dish Racks for Kitchen Counter- Rustproof Kitchen Dish Drying Rack with Drainboard,2 in 1 Small Dish Rack Drainer Set with Sponge Holder,Saving S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a1Swvi7TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUY ONE GET ONE: You will be Able to Get a Dish Drying Rack and a Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink as a Set.The Set of Dish Drying Rack and Sponge Holder Can be a Useful and Convenient Addition to Any Home.The Dish Drying Rack Can Be Used to Hold and Air Dry Dishes after They Have Been Washed, While the Sponge Holder Can Be Used to Store a Sponge and Scrubber for Washing Dishes.They are the Convenient and Practical Kitchen Tools That Can Help You Keep Your Dishes Clean And Organized While Also Keeping Your Sink and Countertops Clutter-free.Now Only Pay For a Dish Rack and Take It Home With the Sponge Holder at the Same Time. COMPACT DISH RACK: This Dish Drying Rack Has a Compact Design.Compact Size Fits Easily on Most Kitchen Countertops.If You Have Limited Counter Space, You May Consider This Compact Countertop Dish Drying Rack.It Would be Great for Small Kitchens or for Use While Camping or Traveling.The Dimensions of the Dish Rack is 14\" X 9\" X 4\".it Has A Utensil Holder, a Separate Area for Plates And Bowls.The Dish Drying Rack Can Freestand on the Kitchen Counter. It Has a Removable Drainboard to Catch Excess Water and Non-slip Feet Can Keep It in Place on the Kitchen Counter.This Dish Racks For Kitchen Counter is a Great Choice for the Families of 2-3 People. SPONGE HOLDER FOR KITCHEN SINK: This Sponge Holder is a Kitchen Accessory That is Designed to Hold a Sponge and Scrubber.It Helps to Keep Sponges Organized and Easily Accessible, So You Can always Find the Sponge You Need When You Need It.This Sponge Holder is Made of Stainless Steel,It is More Durable and Resistant to Rust and Stains.And It is Easy to Clean.Our Sponge Holder has a Built-in Drain Board to Catch Any Excess Water from Your Sponge or Dish Brush.This Can Help Sponges to Dry More Effectively Between Uses and Extend the Lifespan of Your Sponges.A Well-designed Sponge Holder Can Add a Touch of Style to Your Kitchen Sink Area and Enhance the Overall Appearance of Your Kitchen. STRONG BEARING CAPACITY AND RUSTOROOF: Stainless Steel is a Strong and Durable Material That is often Used in the Construction of Dish Rack Because of Its High Bearing Capacity. This Means That It is Able to Support Heavy Loads Without Breaking Or Becoming Damaged.LKKL Dish Rack is Made of Stainless Steel with 5mm Thicker Diameter,so It Is More Stable,the Others are only 2-3mm.In Daily Use,the Dish Rack is Often Exposed to the Water from the Dishes,So Rust Prevention is Very Important.Our Dish Racks are Coated with a Rust-inhibiting Finish to Help Protect Them Against Rust And Corrosion,and Ensure That It is Able to Withstand the Rigors Of Daily Use and Remain in Good Condition Over Time. PRACTICAL GIFT: A Dish Rack Can Be a Practical Gift for Anyone Who Does a Lot of Cooking and Dishwashing. Here Are a Few Ideas for How a Dish Rack Could Be a Thoughtful Gift.For the Busy Home Cook: the Dish Rack is a Great Gift to Someone Who Spends a Lot of Time in the Kitchen, it can Help Them Keep Dishes Organized and Easily Accessible.For The Eco-conscious Friend:a Dish Rack Can Be a More Environmentally Friendly Alternative to Using Disposable Dishcloths.As a Gift to Someone Who is Looking to Reduce Use of Disposable Products.For the Small Kitchen Dweller: A Dish Rack is a Great Gift to Someone Who Lives in a Small Space to Help Them Make the Most of Their Limited Space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a1Swvi7TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LKKL","source_asin":"B0BLCC1WF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCC1WF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCC1WF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
