window.products.push({"id":444601,"name":"RANERANE Backflow Incense Holder Waterfall Incense Burner,with 40 Sandalwood Incense Sticks 30 Incense Cones,Aromatherapy Ornament Statues Home Decor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W91v91kxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁Function and Widely Use : Sandalwood's rich aroma and long lasting fragrance help purify the air, promote relaxation and meditation, improve sleep quality and relieve anxiety and stress. Its presence creates a pleasant and soothing atmosphere in spaces as diverse as living rooms, bedrooms, studies, offices, meditation rooms and yoga studios. Even when not used as incense, it can still serve as a beautiful decorative element. 🎁Use and Cleaning : To ensure a satisfying experience with our backflow incense burner, we recommend placing it in a calm, sheltered spot. Using tweezers, light the backflow incense cones and delicately position it on the incense cone holder. The mesmerizing and enigmatic incense waterfall will soon unfold before your eyes. After enjoying its beauty, cleaning is a breeze. Simply wipe it with a damp cloth or rinse it under running water, and any stains will vanish without difficulty. 🎁Great Gift Idea : With its exquisite appearance and mysterious waterfall effect, it is a handpicked stress relief gift for friends, family and others who care about you. It is also an ideal gift choice for occasions such as New Year's Day, Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, birthdays and other occasions. 🎁You will get : This incense waterfall burner can be used with cone incense or incense sticks, no need to buy additional accessories, the matching brass incense sticks holder is also suitable for a variety of sizes of incense sticks. Package includes: statues cone incense burner, 40 sandalwood incense sticks, 30 sandalwood incense cones, brass incense sticks burner, non-slip fireproof mat, tweezers. 🎁Best Service : We adhere to our craft, each ceramic product is carefully crafted by hand, and pay strict attention to the quality of production. If you have any questions or need help after receiving the product, please contact us, we provide 24 hours of service, in the first time for you to solve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W91v91kxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RANERANE","source_asin":"B0C1X1116T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1X1116T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1X1116T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
