window.products.push({"id":444698,"name":"WOHAIXO Ironing Board Cover and Pad, Standard Size 15\" x 54\" Iron Board Replacement Cover, 4 Layers Extra Thick Iron Board Cover Resist Scorching and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNELgkwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton 【Standard Size】The ironing board cover and pad fits 13-15 inch in width and 52-54 inch in length standard full size ironing boards, One size does not always fit all! Please measure your board before purchase. (please note that the ironing board is not included). We suggest 10 minutes ironing with iron set on the highest setting with steam to eliminate creases caused by package when received 【Thick Padding】4 layers heavy duty padding provides exceptional durability to iron board cover and pad. Top layer (1st) is extremely scorch and stain resistant cotton fabric. Felt padding (2nd) provides extra heat resistant structure. Eco foam (3rd) provides better steam circulation. Durable and thick felt lining (4th) will maintain a flat shape during ironing 【Perfect Fit】Elasticized edges create the look of a custom cover, keep iron board cover with padding in place the boards, Besides, added 2 Elastic Clips, makes it a great improvement in fit and tightness, which helps the cover to stay securely in place while you iron, very easy to use 【Premium Fabric】WOHAIXO ironing board cover is made of 100% cotton scorch & stain assistance, thicker synthetic fiber and breathable cotton. Provide extra heat resistant structure and better steam circulation, Compared with others, WOHAIXO is more durable 【Reflective Heat】 Silver coated top layer reflects the heat of iron back to the clothes so you achieve perfect and wrinkle free clothes in a fraction of time. It's like having the iron heat on both sides of your clothing at the same time. It also absorbs less water than regular covers. You’ll notice how our ironing board covers eliminate the creases and annoying folds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNELgkwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOHAIXO","source_asin":"B0BJ33NFYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ33NFYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ33NFYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444699,"name":"RESPAWN RSP-3010 Computer Ergonomic Height Adjustable Gaming Desk, 52.6 in, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sy59odE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take your game to new heights with the RESPAWN 3010 Gaming Computer Desk, in Gray, with pneumatic height adjustment. This ergonomic desk allows you to go from sitting to standing with the touch of a lever. Controlled by pneumatics, the desk height starts at 28.125\" and can rise up to 43.875\", providing super smooth movement. The ergonomic features also include a beveled front edge for a comfortable place for your arms to rest and a back-mounted monitor shelf positioned at eye level to prevent head and neck strain. Accessories like headphones, speakers, and drinks all have their own place, at the sides of table, to provide the maximum usable desk space. An award-nominated brand, RESPAWN is committed to your satisfaction and covers this desk with our RESPAWN 5-Year Limited Warranty. Easily turn your battlestation into the envy of your friends with the RSP-3010.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sy59odE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RESPAWN","source_asin":"B08FCFHCD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FCFHCD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FCFHCD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444700,"name":"Ceiling Curtain Rod Bracket, Heavy Duty Curtain Rod Holder, Stainless Steel, Matte Black Ceiling Curtain Rods Hooks Hangers Fit for 1 1/4 Inch Drapery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LLrSNzPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌳【LOCK ROD IN PLACE】Designed with adjustable screws at curtain rod bracket cup, fixing rod firmly, compared with no screw ceiling curtain rod hooks, efficiently prevent the rod from shaking or scratching when sliding drapery. ♦️TIPS: ceiling curtain rod holders can accommodate a maximum diameter of 1-1/4 inch rod, please check the size before purchasing. 🌳【CEILING MOUNT OR WALL MOUNT】The closed design of cup, making curtain brackets can be flexibly mounted vertically or horizontally, either work as ceiling mount curtain rod bracket or curtain rod hooks for wall, more practical. Whether you want hang curtain from ceiling or hang decorative thing from wall, drapery rod brackets can finish its work well. 🌳【HEAVY DUTY CURTAIN ROD HOLDER】Curtain rod ceiling bracket is made by solid stainless steel, strong hardness, not easy bent or break; also comes with 3 holes-fixed design at mounting base, compared with other ceiling curtain hook which just have two holes, more stable after mounting, strength the load bearing capacity. Each ceiling curtain rod hanger easily support weight of 11lb, can support heavy/ light curtains no pressure. 🌳【WIDE RANGE OF APPLICATION】Ceiling curtain hangers have exquisite black paint, sleek edge and no burr, suitable for any style home décor. Curtain rod holders brackets can be used as ceiling curtain brackets for floor-to-ceiling curtain as room divider; clothes level bracket for hanging clothes/ties, shower curtain rod holder etc. Perfectly applied in balcony, laundry rooms and other storage rods for clothes and other objects. 🌳【WHAT YOU WILL GET & GURANTEE】You will get 4 pack black ceiling rod holders and all mounting hardware for wall/ ceiling mount. ♦️PLEASE NOTE: the hexagon screw wrench is also included. ☺️If you are not satisfied with closet rod brackets, please contact us. We provide satisfied after-sale service and 24hrs customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LLrSNzPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BSAOCRT","source_asin":"B0BXS17R18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXS17R18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXS17R18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
