window.products.push({"id":444707,"name":"Black Pampas Grass Decor Tall 27.5\",Faux Large Pompous Grass 6 Stems,Artificial Dried Pompas Grass,Fake Fluffy Reed Floral Branches for Vase Filler Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxdRcv51L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[💐 -Surprising Present]:Faux Pampas Grass with fairy lights,as the night falls,the fairy lights is twinkling in the dark,allowing you surrounded by this romantic vibes.The fairy lights entwined in the pampas grass,as if faint glow of starlight,makes you feel like a walk on the grasslands under the stars. The pampas fairy light decor will add romantic vibes to your home,and it aslo can be used as a night light,accompanying you into every sweet dreams. [💐 -Why Choose Artificial Grass]:The tall and fluffy stems of our pampas grass decoration not only have the realistic appearance of natural pampas grass, and do not require any cleaning or maintenance. The versatility of the pampas grass decoration allows you to bend it to any height you need, giving you a warm and comfortable feeling, and making you feel intoxicated in nature [💐 -Handmade]:Each Artificial Pampas Grass is made of high quality silk with deliciated handmade technique,make sure every stitch durable and each strand has a soft fluffy touch. Stems are made of metal wire and wrapped by paper,sturdy enough to bent and adjusted the length to fit many sizes of vases. It can fit both for tabletop or floor vases with a chic boho modern decor to your home. [💐 -No Shedding & Permanently Placed]:Unlike dried real pampas grass,the Fake Pompous Grass has no smell,mess and allergens,long lasting and no maintenance required.It is friendly with your children and pets.lifelike replica of the thin botanical pompuss grass let you enjoy the delicate beauty for years to come with no maintenance. [💐 -Boho Decor & Versatile]: Our Pampas Grass Decor is very suitable for bedroom,living room,dining room,kitchen,hallway,entry way or any space.They are also a great addition to wedding,party,flower arrangements,lifestyle photography,bohemian decorate and so on.A wonderful gift for families and friends on any important events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxdRcv51L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ghexartf","source_asin":"B0B4DXQNFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DXQNFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DXQNFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
