window.products.push({"id":444798,"name":"Placemats for Dining Table, Washable Heat-Resistant Table Mats, Stain Resistant Woven Vinyl Place Mats Placemats Set of 4 (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k2MOVQbkL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Heat Resistance: Withstand temperatures up to approximately 185°F or 85°C. The effective insulation materials of placemats set of 4 can be used for a long time.Protect our table from hot foods Easy to Clean: Washable placemats, wipe clean and dries quickly.No fading and deform.Hand wash in warm soapy water and wipe dry Home Decoration: Elegant and fashionable table mats, decorate your tables will definitely be perfect, improve your dining quality Woven Vinyl Material: Eco-friendly 70% PVC +30% polyester. 17.7x11.8 inch (45x30cm), package includes 4PCS place mat Widely Use: Decor to your table in dinning hall, kitchen, restaurants, coffee shops, hotel and garden.Also can be placed under vase or ashtrays to complement the look","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k2MOVQbkL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIOMK","source_asin":"B098R43DP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098R43DP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098R43DP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":444799,"name":"Bent Glass Straws 10 inch Clear Reusable Drinking Straws, ECO Friendly, Made in The USA, BPA Free Ocean-ease 4 Pack Tall x 9.5mm Wide Straws, Organic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817EaJtOqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ocean-ease Reusable Glass Straws are Easy on the Ocean Be Ocean friendly and ECO friendly with Ocean-ease plastic free glass straws!Our ECO friendly product is 100% toxin FREE, BPA FREE, lead FREE, sustainable, and 100% recyclable, thereby creating no harm for the environment (unlike silicone straws which are difficult to find any recyclers).Ocean-ease glass straws are made in the USA by our glass artisan who specially handcrafts each glass straw!Crafted from strong borasilicate glass, our durable reusable glass straws are made of the same material as those long lasting glass Pyrex bowls!Bent glass drinking straws provide an easy and enjoyable sipping experience, and the smooth rounded edges are soothing to the lips.Our clear glass straws will add beauty to your favorite refreshing beverages and glassware!10 inch tall reusable straws are perfect for smoothie straws and they add pizazz to your juice and sparkling drinks. Sip your morning coffee or hot tea through Ocean-ease glass straws with less teeth staining.When enjoying an ice cold drink, glass straws are easy on sensitive teeth (unlike stainless steel straws-brrr!).Easy to clean in the dishwasher, or just rinse after use. We have included a sturdy straw cleaning brush in case of stubborn fruit from a smoothie.Carry your straws with you in the organic cotton and plastic free straw carrying case.The straw carrying pouch is hand sewn in the USA of GOTS certified organic cotton, and is plastic free with no zippers, velcro or snaps!Lift the cotton flap over the top to open the straw carrying bag.Easy to clean - hand wash and air dry, or machine wash and tumble dry.We’ve even included an organic wipe cloth to use when you’re out and about to wipe the glass straws before sipping or to catch any leftover drips when tucking the straws back into your carry bag!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817EaJtOqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ocean-ease","source_asin":"B07RYG67P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RYG67P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RYG67P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
