window.products.push({"id":444847,"name":"Modus Furniture Yosemite Solid Wood Dresser, Cafe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1099.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71foA-1D0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Yosemite Solid Wood Dresser in Café is constructed from solid pine to replicate the industrial, turn of the century aesthetic. Sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes feature English dovetail joinery for maximum rigidity and lasting quality; dust cover under bottom drawer; Full extension, ball bearing drawer slides for smooth, efficient operation and ample weight capacity; felt lined top drawers. Can be used with or without 3-3/8-inch legs which can be installed in 5 minutes. Hammered metal bar pulls add to the industrial appeal. Hand-hewn planks are carefully selected to preserve natural imperfections and varying depths from the milling process. Unique café finish is a dark gray with just enough opacity to show clearly defined wood grain and a low-sheen lacquer to enhance depth. Wood is kiln dried for added strength. Please keep in mind that natural wood must breathe and is affected by environmental conditions. Expect to see shrinkage or expansion and plank movement over time. These normal occurrences will not affect the structural integrity of the piece. With proper care, this solid wood furniture will last for generations. Fronts, tops and sides are solid pine; tray, drawer boxes, drawer bottoms, back panels and dust covers are hardwood plywood. Covered by a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Product Dimensions: 18-Inch by 62-Inch by 36-Inch. Weighs 128-pounds. The Yosemite bedroom recreates the utilitarian look of early 20th century with its exposed bolts and hammered metal pulls. Crafted entirely from solid wood, The Yosemite bedroom is equally suited for a post-industrial downtown loft, a swanky brownstone or a suburban farmhouse. The versatile finish pairs well with vibrant colors or muted, earthy tones. Soften the industrial aesthetic with rugs and bedding or embrace it with minimalist textiles and edgy metal accents. Zinc pulls and bolts match most stainless or brushed nickel accessories and contrast well with bronze or copper tones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71foA-1D0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B09D8X9SCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D8X9SCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D8X9SCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
