window.products.push({"id":444849,"name":"Cookie Decorating Supplies Kit 118pcs with Storage Case, Royal Sugar Piping Bags and Tips Icing Set, Turntable Scribe Decoration Tools for Kids and Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EplT0iTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥳 Perfect Gift Set for Beginners and Pro - HKNMTT Sugar cookie decorating kits feature all the tools you need to make your holiday cookie dreams come true, from piping bags and tips to decorating utensils! Comes with a elegant storage case to be a particularly good gift set for kids and icing cookie lovers! ❤️ Food Grade High-Quality Supplies - Equiped with 2pcs 12\" resuable silicone TPI piping bags and 20pcs 12\" disposable bags, which are special for cookies. You never need to worry about the embarrassing incident of the bag burst, all the pastry bags are thick and durable. 🌺 Health & Safe & Popular Icing Tips - A careful selection of 12 basic and popular piping nozzles, from lining, flooding, to floral decoration. No more problem of difficult clean makes bacteria residuals or scratching your hands caused by those seam nozzles. With 304 stainless steel & seamless craft, choose the better one for kids and yourself! 🍪 Thoughtful Cookie Decorating Utensils - All tools your need while decorating are here! 360-degree 4\" acrylic turntable totate smoothly to support you fill fine details of cookies. 10pcs decoration brushes for unique icing patterns and highlighting with Luster Powders. Scriber needles and tweezer help you make your works better looking. 🎁 What's in the Box - PIPING BAGS & TIPS SET: 2 * reusable silicone TPU piping bags, 20 * disposable pastry bags, 12 * icing nozzles ( 4 rounds + 1 leaf + 7 flowers), 1 * flower nail, 4 * couplers, 4 * silicone bag ties, 4 * bag clips. DECORATING TOOLS: 1 * acrylic turntable, 2 * scribes, 10 * decoration brushes, 1 * tweezer, 1 * edible pen. OTHER SUPPLIES: 5 * heart cookie cutters, 50 * package Bags, 1 * clean brush. 🥰 Enjoy Your Cookie Baking Icing Time - Baking cookies is a wonderful art form. Cookie cutters turn dough into festive-shaped confections, and the icing and sprinkles bring them to life. This is a so lovely time to make beautiful cookies with family, ideal for all holidays like Halloween, Christmas, Kid's Parties, Valentines, Easter, Graduation, Housewarming, Anniversary, and Mother’s Day. 100% satisfaction promise, get it with no risk!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EplT0iTcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUSHYUM","source_asin":"B0BN7S66YN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-444849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN7S66YN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN7S66YN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
